3
00:00:09,925 --> 00:00:11,302
Do you have multiple ankles?

4
00:00:12,345 --> 00:00:13,359
Why are you angry?

5
00:00:13,360 --> 00:00:14,513
That's not like you.

6
00:00:17,224 --> 00:00:18,106
Take it. You left it

7
00:00:18,107 --> 00:00:19,185
