13
00:01:11,779 --> 00:01:13,078
If you say it one more time

14
00:01:13,079 --> 00:01:14,115
it'll be the 50th time.

15
00:01:25,501 --> 00:01:26,501
Han Se-woon

16
00:01:27,962 --> 00:01:28,962
why did you wait for me?
